window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It started with a threat . . . <i>\"Shut your mouth or pay the consequences.\"</i></p> <p>That's the problem with being the only female in the world's largest rock band. I attract crazed fans and stalkers on a daily basis. Much to Adrian's displeasure.</p> <p>As our band manager, it's Adrian Hale's job to protect us. And that's all I am to him . . . a job. Because I've kept him at a distance for the sake of my career . . . among other reasons.</p> <p>There's a secret I've been keeping. There's a past I've been hiding. There's a fire spreading inside me that's burning to get out.</p> <p>Some things are worth going down in flames for. When Adrian learns the truth, will he still think I'm one of them?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
